1
00:00:08,175 --> 00:00:13,005
Who is at work, where, and
what each of them is on.

2
00:00:13,459 --> 00:00:21,540
Grouped the way the work is: one column
per place, with the quiet ones saying so.

3
00:00:21,992 --> 00:00:27,240
What has happened since you last
looked, in the order it happened.

4
00:00:27,692 --> 00:00:32,243
And the short list of things that
are stopped until you say something.

5
00:00:32,697 --> 00:00:37,062
None of it needs a report to be run, and
none of it goes stale while you read it.

6
00:00:37,515 --> 00:00:41,927
Next: asking your own data a
question nobody built a screen for.

